  "ja11:1.1": "Hoti sīlavataṃ attho ",
  "ja11:1.2": "paṭisanthāravuttinaṃ, (Dhpd. p. 146). ",
  "ja11:1.3": "Lakkhaṇaṃ passa āyantaṃ ",
  "ja11:1.4": "ñātisaṃghapurakkhataṃ, ",
  "ja11:1.5": "atha passas' imaṃ Kāḷaṃ ",
  "ja11:1.6": "suvihīnaṃ va ñātihīti. ",
